---
// src/components/Experience.astro
---

<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 py-16 border-b border-outline-variant/30" id="experience">
<div class="mb-10">
<span class="text-label-md font-label-md text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Practical Impact</span>
<h2 class="text-headline-md font-headline-md text-on-surface">Experiencia Profesional</h2>
</div>

<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/40 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm mb-8">
<!-- Role Title & Timeframe Header -->
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/30 pb-6 mb-6 gap-2">
<div>
<h3 class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Backend Developer</h3>
<p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">
Kinnovis · Mantenimiento de SaaS B2B en producción
</p>
</div>
<div class="text-label-md font-label-md px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40 text-on-surface self-start md:self-auto font-medium">
(Tu fecha de inicio) al Presente
</div>
</div>
<!-- Stack Bar with smooth rounded-2xl -->
<div class="mb-8 p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
<span class="text-label-sm font-label-sm font-semibold text-secondary mr-2">TECH STACK:</span>
<span class="text-label-sm font-label-sm text-on-surface bg-surface-container-lowest px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40">Linux Server</span>
<span class="text-label-sm font-label-sm text-on-surface bg-surface-container-lowest px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40">HTTP / REST</span>
<span class="text-label-sm font-label-sm text-on-surface bg-surface-container-lowest px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40">AI Workflows</span>
<span class="text-label-sm font-label-sm text-on-surface bg-surface-container-lowest px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40">Databases</span>
</div>
<!-- Dual Column: Logros Técnicos + Liderazgo -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
<!-- Column 1: Technical Achievements -->
<div>
<h4 class="text-title-md font-title-md text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" data-icon="terminal">terminal</span>
Production Troubleshooting
</h4>
<ul class="space-y-4">
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2"></span>
<p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
<strong>Root Cause Analysis:</strong> Diagnóstico de errores críticos en producción analizando logs de servidores Linux y trazando el ciclo de vida completo de las peticiones HTTP/API.
</p>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2"></span>
<p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
<strong>System Reliability:</strong> Implementación de fixes estables asegurando la integridad del sistema SaaS utilizado por clientes reales, priorizando la arquitectura limpia frente a "parches" temporales.
</p>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2"></span>
<p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
<strong>AI-Assisted Workflows:</strong> Uso pragmático de herramientas asistidas por IA (Cursor/Claude) para acelerar el desarrollo y diagnóstico sin comprometer la auditoría humana estricta y los fundamentos de diseño.
</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<!-- Column 2: Leadership & Agile -->
<div>
<h4 class="text-title-md font-title-md text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary" data-icon="account_tree">account_tree</span>
Impacto
</h4>
<ul class="space-y-4">
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary mt-2"></span>
<p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
<strong>Manos en el barro:</strong> Experiencia comercial directa manteniendo un sistema vivo, lidiando con la deuda técnica y las exigencias de un entorno B2B.
</p>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary mt-2"></span>
<p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
<strong>Adaptabilidad Tecnológica:</strong> Transición activa hacia el ecosistema empresarial Java/Spring Boot para complementar mi base sólida en Node.js, TypeScript y React.
</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</section>
